{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>50 LEVELS OF  GAMEPLAY!!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192390/extras/9e8d4d7c1681d4aa4a764275b1f7a23d.poster.avif?t=1762307614\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192390/extras/9e8d4d7c1681d4aa4a764275b1f7a23d.webm?t=1762307614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192390/extras/9e8d4d7c1681d4aa4a764275b1f7a23d.mp4?t=1762307614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the world turns short of Mana, Mirage, the city of illusions, is in danger of collapsing! Help Kyuboy\u2019d make his way through 50 mind-boggling puzzles to save his hometown from impending doom!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>BRAIN-HURTING PUZZLE MECHANICS!!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192390/extras/1dbe6ec0ca6b1077db5a6940a0b025d2.poster.avif?t=1762307614\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192390/extras/1dbe6ec0ca6b1077db5a6940a0b025d2.webm?t=1762307614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192390/extras/1dbe6ec0ca6b1077db5a6940a0b025d2.mp4?t=1762307614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level challenges your perception and forces you to see the world from different angles. The cuboid movement also tests your spatial reasoning and problem solving skills in small spaces. Use the power of perspective to navigate impossible terrain. But beware, one wrong move and you will have to start the level again!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIVE DIFFERENT ENVIRONMENTS TO EXPLORE!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192390/extras/c85e4289ae0d19093914471d6ed9599a.poster.avif?t=1762307614\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192390/extras/c85e4289ae0d19093914471d6ed9599a.webm?t=1762307614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192390/extras/c85e4289ae0d19093914471d6ed9599a.mp4?t=1762307614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take Kyuboy\u2019d through 5 different environments and enjoy the breathtaking and colourful stylized scenery. Each environment  has its own unique characteristics, ensuring your adventure stays fresh throughout the journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>USE LEVEL OBJECTS TO YOUR ADVANTAGE!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192390/extras/893e019339f47f5f450e83b91ca0f8f5.poster.avif?t=1762307614\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192390/extras/893e019339f47f5f450e83b91ca0f8f5.webm?t=1762307614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192390/extras/893e019339f47f5f450e83b91ca0f8f5.mp4?t=1762307614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some obstacles may seem impossible to overcome. Take a look at your surrounding environment and what you have in your inventory, perhaps the solution has been right in front of your eyes all along!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHALLENGE YOUR OWN BEST SCORES!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192390/extras/2b23ae001626066e4aac3f4ded00e3ff.poster.avif?t=1762307614\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192390/extras/2b23ae001626066e4aac3f4ded00e3ff.webm?t=1762307614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192390/extras/2b23ae001626066e4aac3f4ded00e3ff.mp4?t=1762307614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like you can beat your own score? Wanna brag about your  efficiency in your local community? Challenge yourself to see if you can beat your previous records!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"City of Illusions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3192390/b3aa39fcabf01b1bbad92583055d10b236cfab99.jpg"},{"name":"Touch Grass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3192390/b3aa39fcabf01b1bbad92583055d10b236cfab99.jpg"},{"name":"Mt. Ignifer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3192390/b3aa39fcabf01b1bbad92583055d10b236cfab99.jpg"},{"name":"Tristis Fen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3192390/b3aa39fcabf01b1bbad92583055d10b236cfab99.jpg"},{"name":"Dimension of the Unknown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3192390/b3aa39fcabf01b1bbad92583055d10b236cfab99.jpg"},{"name":"Workplace Accident","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3192390/b3aa39fcabf01b1bbad92583055d10b236cfab99.jpg"},{"name":"Cocky Cuboid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3192390/b3aa39fcabf01b1bbad92583055d10b236cfab99.jpg"},{"name":"H